# Bilbo's Deadly Slice's "target creature" is any creature, the caster's included (CR 701.8a): Bot1 destroys its own Memnite at
# instant speed with the Slice, paid from Black Lotus's {B}{B}{B}; Bot2's Memnite is left alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Bilbo's Deadly Slice
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Bilbo's Deadly Slice.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Bilbo's Deadly Slice; Memnite; Black Lotus
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
